    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Kitchen:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Appliances are unplugged and wrapped in anti‑static film. Utensils and cookware go into lightweight, labeled containers. A separate stack of heavy pots is kept ready for quick loading.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Utility &amp; Storage:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Tools, cleaning supplies, and seasonal items are sorted by weight, ensuring that lighter items are placed on top of heavier ones.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ec489922; color: #ec4899; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">05</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Specialty Items:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Paintings, mirrors, and antiques are double‑boxed with custom foam, then sealed with clear tape and marked “FRAGILE – THIS SIDE UP.”</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Once every box is sealed and labeled, the loading team secures the cargo into the truck using straps, wheel chocks, and a weight‑distribution plan that keeps the vehicle balanced. We also install a protective film over the truck’s interior to guard against scratches.</p>

<p>During transit, the driver follows a pre‑approved route that minimizes turns and steep inclines. The truck is equipped with a GPS tracker and a temperature sensor, ensuring real‑time monitoring of conditions.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Arrival at the destination marks the start of the uncrating phase.</p>
